{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達已經調整下一代Vera Rubin人工智能計算平台的部分硬件規格，包括HBM4高帶寬顯存帶寬以及NVLink高速互連帶寬。與此前公佈或流傳的指標相比，新規格有所下降，但橫向擴展網絡帶寬則出現提升。這一變化可能意味着，英偉達正在根據實際量產情況重新平衡晶片性能、供應能力和系統成本。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583904.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.752686+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:11:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_hash":"eac72105349bc9f4d20f774695c6289f838ad6fe212c101dc4ebe36c446023b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}